5,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I need to understand the financial baseline before we move a single desk.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Minato,,I’m curious about the physical comfort of the current spots.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,My schedule is tight. I need to know how much time this move steals.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,We never say who gets the bad seats. I want to fix that.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I worry about who I’ll actually talk to.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@May, time is money, but I need the actual cost first.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Shunichi, I agree. Comfort is invisible but real.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"@Victoria, if the move takes days, my gaps vanish.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Daisuke, proximity dictates conversation. We should check that.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shunichi, yes. I want to see how people interacted before.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I will look into the billing and the facilities quote.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Minato,,I’ll check the sound readings and the physio’s note.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,I need the morning routine timings and the badge records.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I’ll review the drawn plan and the past shuffles.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I want to see the joiners' reports and the project strands.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
