35,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"The billing is by area, not heads. Empty desks still cost us 41,000 yen monthly.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Minato,,"@Victoria, that’s expensive. But the sound meter shows the window side is nine decibels quieter.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,May,,"@Minato, quiet is good, but the morning routine took up to nine minutes per person.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, nine minutes is a start. The past shuffles dragged on for two weeks each.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shunichi, two weeks is long. The joiners said they learned by overhearing, not notes.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Daisuke, overhearing is efficient, but the facilities quote is 6,200 yen per desk move.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Victoria, money is important, but the physio said my chair takes days to settle.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,May,,"@Minato, days to settle? That eats my gaps. I need speed.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, speed costs money. The plan gives three desks to the interior wall.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shunichi, interior wall? That’s where the noise is. I don’t want to sit there.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Daisuke, the noise is real, but the cost of moving is higher.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Minato,,"@Victoria, I need the quiet spot. I can’t work if it’s loud.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,May,,"@Minato, if you stay put, I lose my morning. We need a fast solution.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, staying put is unfair. We must assign the bad seats explicitly.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shunichi, I agree. But I want to sit near people I talk to.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"We need a stable layout to control the 6,200 yen fees.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Minato,,I need acoustic certainty. The window row is essential for me.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,May,,I need to protect my schedule. Rotating desks is too disruptive.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,We must name who takes the interior wall seats to avoid resentment.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I want to sit where I can hear the team.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
