60,3,1,talk,Victoria,,"Option A fixes the desks. It stops the 6,200 yen bleeding.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Minato,,Option A lets me keep the window seat. I need that quiet.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,May,,Option A is stable. Rotating blocks would steal my morning gaps.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,Option A allows us to assign the interior wall seats explicitly.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,Option A means I sit with the same people. That’s good for talking.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Daisuke, stability helps conversation, but it also locks in the costs.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Minato,,"@Victoria, I’m voting A. I need the acoustic certainty.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,May,,"@Minato, I agree. Option B is too chaotic for my schedule.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, Option B forces constant interaction. Option A is fairer if assigned.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shunichi, I’m worried about Option C. No fixed seat means no fixed team.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Victoria,,Option C is risky. First-come basis favors early arrivals.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Minato,,Option C means I might get the loud spot. I reject it.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,May,,Option C is unpredictable. I need to know my desk before I arrive.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,Option C hides the unfairness. We must choose A and assign seats.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,Option C feels lonely. I want to know who is beside me.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Victoria,,I vote A. It protects the budget and allows explicit assignment.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Minato,,I vote A. I need the window seat for my comfort.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,May,,I vote A. It protects my morning routine.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Shunichi,,I vote A. We must name the interior wall seats.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Daisuke,,I vote A. I want to sit with the team.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
